# MCP index

Use MCP **on demand** when the task needs external truth (live docs, DB schema, browser state). Skip with a one-line reason for pure local refactors or docs-only edits.

| Need | Attach rule |
| ---- | ----------- |
| Library / framework version-specific behavior | `51-mcp-context7` |
| Supabase schema, SQL, migrations | `52-mcp-supabase` |
| UI flow verification in browser | `53-mcp-playwright` |

Config: `.cursor/mcp.json`. Do not put secrets in rules or commits.
